{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "New Paths"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Spending Quality Time Together "}, {"type": "position", "content": 10}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 1}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contents. "}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le01ob10re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking About the the Future"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "There are several ways in which we can talk about the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "We use the <span class=\"italic\">present simple</span> for something scheduled or arranged:<br><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">We have</span> a lesson next Monday.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "We can use the <span class=\"italic\">present continuous</span> for plans or arrangements:<br><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">I'm playing</span> footbal tomorrow.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "We use <span class=\"italic\">will</span> when we make predictions about the future:<br><span class=\"italic\">I think Italy <span class=\"strong\">will win</span> the World Cup.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "We also use <span class=\"italic\">will</span> to make offers or promises:<br><span class=\"italic\">Mary <span class=\"strong\">will help</span> you with your homework.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "We use <span class=\"italic\">(be) going to</span> to talk about plans and intentions:<br>I'<span class=\"strong\">m going to drive</span> to work today.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "We also use <span class=\"italic\">(be) going to</span> when we can see something is likely to happen:<br><span class=\"italic\">Be careful! <span class=\"strong\">You are going to fall</span>.</span>"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking about Personal Qualities"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you talk about people, you often describe their personal qualities.   You can talk about their  behavior and their personalities."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Behavior is the way a person  acts or conducts themselves. <br><span class=\"italic\">Example: Tom is usually relaxed, but today he seems nervous. </span> "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Personality is a person's  general character (they way they are). <br><span class=\"italic\">Example: Sandra is a tidy person. Her apartment is always clean and neat.</span> "}, {"type": "text", "content": "We use adjectives to talk about behavior and personality."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":11,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Synonym\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"dedicated\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"committed; devoted\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"talented\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"skilled; accomplished\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"gracious\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"hospitable; accommodating\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"experimental\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"open-minded\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"conservative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"traditional; unprogressive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"stubborn\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"inflexible; single-minded\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"energetic\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"active; lively\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ambitious\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\