d! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I\u2018m having a taste night with in a few weeks. You can come then!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'll be there. I'm very experimental when it comes to food. I'll eat anything you serve!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Your stomach is a bottomless pit, Peter! You are constantly hungry!<br>"}, {"time": "53000", "image": "engenn6le01ob10re2img06.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I don't mind. We're all going to cook different dishes to try.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: We?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Other people I know who are dedicated chefs like me! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'm not eating the day before! What time does it start?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oh Peter!<br>"}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "audio", "value": "engenn6le01ob10re6aud01"}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "text", "id": 2, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}